Profiles

This repository contains unofficial client profiles built from third-party
ruleset projects. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the
upstream projects or client developers.

Current third-party source:

Sukka Ruleset
Upstream: https://github.com/SukkaW/Surge
Runtime rule server: https://ruleset.skk.moe
Profile status: Modified and adapted for complete Mihomo, Shadowrocket, Stash,
and Quantumult X use

For Mihomo, Shadowrocket, and Stash, the upstream rule files are not vendored
in this repository. They are fetched at runtime and remain subject to their
upstream licenses and copyright notices.

Exception: the Quantumult X profile references pre-converted lists under
qx/Rules/, which are derivative works of Sukka Ruleset vendored in this
repository. They are generated by tools/sukka-qx.mjs from
https://ruleset.skk.moe and carry the upstream AGPL-3.0 license; the conversion
script records the upstream source, timestamp, and content hash of every file.

Most Sukka Ruleset files are licensed under AGPL-3.0. The upstream china_ip
data is licensed under CC BY-SA 2.0. The Quantumult X profile consumes
china_ip through Quantumult X's built-in FILTER_REGION snippet instead of
redistributing that data.

See each upstream repository for authoritative license and attribution details.
